<title>USA: Xeikon N.V. Q1 proforma shr loss $0.14. [CORRECTED 15:43 GMT]</title>
<headline>Xeikon N.V. Q1 proforma shr loss $0.14. [CORRECTED 15:43 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>Pro forma</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.14   profit	 $0.01</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,914   profit	   275</p>
<p> Revs			11,837		   18,807</p>
<p>Pro forma</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  28,629		   24,634</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Oper loss $4.188 million vs profit $352,000.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 includes nonrecurring charge of about $1.7 million from the purchase of a research and development unit of Agfa-Gevaert. Excluding this charge, the net loss would have been $2.2 million (corrects from $3.2 million), or $0.08 per share.</p>
